OL,3,ATommy Robinson charged with failing to
OL,4,Agive phone Pin code to police
OL,5,
OL,6,FFar-right activist Tommy Robinson has
OL,7,Fbeen charged with failing to provide
OL,8,Fhis phone's pin code to police at
OL,9,FHeathrow Airport.
OL,11,FThe alleged incident happened when
OL,12,FRobinson, whose real name is Stephen
OL,13,FYaxley-Lennon, was detained after
OL,14,Freturning to the UK from Russia via
OL,15,FTurkey on 13 June this year.
OL,17,FThe 43-year-old is due to appear at
OL,18,FWestminster Magistrates' Court on 14
OL,19,FDecember, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
