OL,3,ATommy Robinson charged with failing to
OL,4,Agive phone Pin code to police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPosting on X after being charged,
OL,7,FRobinson, describing himself as a
OL,8,Fjournalist, said he "refused the Pin
OL,9,Fbecause it held private messages from
OL,10,Fgrooming gang survivors".
